{
  "snp5.1:0.1": "",
  "snp5.1:0.2": "5. Pārāyanavaggo 982. Vatthugāthā ",
  "snp5.1:1.1": "Kosalānaṃ purā rammā, ",
  "snp5.1:1.2": "agamā dakkhiṇāpathaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:1.3": "Ākiñcaññaṃ patthayāno, ",
  "snp5.1:1.4": "brāhmaṇo mantapāragū. ",
  "snp5.1:2.1": "983. So assakassa visaye, ",
  "snp5.1:2.2": "aḷakassa samāsane; ",
  "snp5.1:2.3": "Vasi godhāvarīkūle, ",
  "snp5.1:2.4": "uñchena ca phalena ca. ",
  "snp5.1:3.1": "984. Tasseva upanissāya, ",
  "snp5.1:3.2": "gāmo ca vipulo ahu; ",
  "snp5.1:3.3": "Tato jātena āyena, ",
  "snp5.1:3.4": "mahāyaññamakappayi. ",
  "snp5.1:4.1": "985. Mahāyaññaṃ yajitvāna, ",
  "snp5.1:4.2": "puna pāvisi assamaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:4.3": "Tasmiṃ paṭipaviṭṭhamhi, ",
  "snp5.1:4.4": "añño āgañchi brāhmaṇo. ",
  "snp5.1:5.1": "986. Ugghaṭṭapādo tasito , ",
  "snp5.1:5.2": "paṅkadanto rajassiro; ",
  "snp5.1:5.3": "So ca naṃ upasaṅkamma, ",
  "snp5.1:5.4": "satāni pañca yācati. ",
  "snp5.1:6.1": "987. Tamenaṃ bāvarī disvā, ",
  "snp5.1:6.2": "āsanena nimantayi; ",
  "snp5.1:6.3": "Sukhañca kusalaṃ pucchi, ",
  "snp5.1:6.4": "idaṃ vacanamabravi. ",
  "snp5.1:7.1": "988. ‘‘Yaṃ kho mama deyyadhammaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:7.2": "sabbaṃ visajjitaṃ mayā; ",
  "snp5.1:7.3": "Anujānāhi me brahme, ",
  "snp5.1:7.4": "natthi pañcasatāni me’’. ",
  "snp5.1:8.1": "989. ‘‘Sace me yācamānassa, ",
  "snp5.1:8.2": "bhavaṃ nānupadassati; ",
  "snp5.1:8.3": "Sattame divase tuyhaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:8.4": "muddhā phalatu sattadhā’’. ",
  "snp5.1:9.1": "990. Abhisaṅkharitvā kuhako, ",
  "snp5.1:9.2": "bheravaṃ so akittayi; ",
  "snp5.1:9.3": "Tassa taṃ vacanaṃ sutvā, ",
  "snp5.1:9.4": "bāvarī dukkhito ahu. ",
  "snp5.1:10.1": "991. Ussussati anāhāro, ",
  "snp5.1:10.2": "sokasallasamappito; ",
  "snp5.1:10.3": "Athopi evaṃ cittassa, ",
  "snp5.1:10.4": "jhāne na ramatī mano. ",
  "snp5.1:11.1": "992. Utrastaṃ dukkhitaṃ disvā, ",
  "snp5.1:11.2": "devatā atthakāminī; ",
  "snp5.1:11.3": "Bāvariṃ upasaṅkamma, ",
  "snp5.1:11.4": "idaṃ vacanamabravi. ",
  "snp5.1:12.1": "993. ‘‘Na so muddhaṃ pajānāti, ",
  "snp5.1:12.2": "kuhako so dhanatthiko; ",
  "snp5.1:12.3": "Muddhani muddhapāte vā, ",
  "snp5.1:12.4": "ñāṇaṃ tassa na vijjati’’. ",
  "snp5.1:13.1": "994. ‘‘Bhotī carahi jānāsi, ",
  "snp5.1:13.2": "taṃ me akkhāhi pucchitā; ",
  "snp5.1:13.3": "Muddhaṃ muddhādhipātañca, ",
  "snp5.1:13.4": "taṃ suṇoma vaco tava’’. ",
  "snp5.1:14.1": "995. ‘‘Ahampetaṃ na jānāmi, ",
  "snp5.1:14.2": "ñāṇamettha na vijjati; ",
  "snp5.1:14.3": "Muddhani muddhādhipāte ca, ",
  "snp5.1:14.4": "jinānaṃ hettha dassanaṃ’’. ",
  "snp5.1:15.1": "996. ‘‘Atha ko carahi jānāti, ",
  "snp5.1:15.2": "asmiṃ pathavimaṇḍale ; ",
  "snp5.1:15.3": "Muddhaṃ muddhādhipātañca, ",
  "snp5.1:15.4": "taṃ me akkhāhi devate’’. ",
  "snp5.1:16.1": "997. ‘‘Purā kapilavatthumhā, ",
  "snp5.1:16.2": "nikkhanto lokanāyako; ",
  "snp5.1:16.3": "Apacco okkākarājassa, ",
  "snp5.1:16.4": "sakyaputto pabhaṅkaro. ",
  "snp5.1:17.1": "998. ‘‘So hi brāhmaṇa sambuddho, ",
  "snp5.1:17.2": "sabbadhammāna pāragū; ",
  "snp5.1:17.3": "Sabbābhiññābalappatto, ",
  "snp5.1:17.4": "sabbadhammesu cakkhumā; ",
  "snp5.1:17.5": "Sabbakammakkhayaṃ patto, ",
  "snp5.1:17.6": "vimutto upadhikkhaye. ",
  "snp5.1:18.1": "999. ‘‘Buddho so bhagavā loke, ",
  "snp5.1:18.2": "dhammaṃ deseti cakkhumā; ",
  "snp5.1:18.3": "Taṃ tvaṃ gantvāna pucchassu, ",
  "snp5.1:18.4": "so te taṃ byākarissati’’. ",
  "snp5.1:19.1": "1000. Sambuddhoti vaco sutvā, ",
  "snp5.1:19.2": "udaggo bāvarī ahu; ",
  "snp5.1:19.3": "Sokassa tanuko āsi, ",
  "snp5.1:19.4": "pītiñca vipulaṃ labhi. ",
  "snp5.1:20.1": "1001. So bāvarī attamano udaggo, ",
  "snp5.1:20.2": "taṃ devataṃ pucchati vedajāto; ",
  "snp5.1:20.3": "‘‘Katamamhi gāme nigamamhi vā pana, ",
  "snp5.1:20.4": "katamamhi vā janapade lokanātho; ",
  "snp5.1:20.5": "Yattha gantvāna passemu , ",
  "snp5.1:20.6": "sambuddhaṃ dvipaduttamaṃ’’ ,. ",
  "snp5.1:21.1": "1002. ‘‘Sāvatthiyaṃ kosalamandire jino, ",
  "snp5.1:21.2": "pahūtapañño varabhūrimedhaso; ",
  "snp5.1:21.3": "So sakyaputto vidhuro anāsavo, ",
  "snp5.1:21.4": "muddhādhipātassa vidū narāsabho’’. ",
  "snp5.1:22.1": "1003. Tato āmantayī sisse, ",
  "snp5.1:22.2": "brāhmaṇe mantapārage; ",
  "snp5.1:22.3": "‘‘Etha māṇavā akkhissaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:22.4": "suṇātha vacanaṃ mama. ",
  "snp5.1:23.1": "1004. ‘‘Yasseso dullabho loke, ",
  "snp5.1:23.2": "pātubhāvo abhiṇhaso; ",
  "snp5.1:23.3": "Svājja lokamhi uppanno, ",
  "snp5.1:23.4": "sambuddho iti vissuto; ",
  "snp5.1:23.5": "Khippaṃ gantvāna sāvatthiṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:23.6": "passavho dvipaduttamaṃ’’. ",
  "snp5.1:24.1": "1005. ‘‘Kathaṃ carahi jānemu, ",
  "snp5.1:24.2": "disvā buddhoti brāhmaṇa; ",
  "snp5.1:24.3": "Ajānataṃ no pabrūhi, ",
  "snp5.1:24.4": "yathā jānemu taṃ mayaṃ’’. ",
  "snp5.1:25.1": "1006. ‘‘Āgatāni hi mantesu, ",
  "snp5.1:25.2": "mahāpurisalakkhaṇā; ",
  "snp5.1:25.3": "Dvattiṃsāni ca byākkhātā, ",
  "snp5.1:25.4": "samattā anupubbaso. ",
  "snp5.1:26.1": "1007. ‘‘Yassete honti gattesu, ",
  "snp5.1:26.2": "mahāpurisalakkhaṇā; ",
  "snp5.1:26.3": "Dveyeva tassa gatiyo, ",
  "snp5.1:26.4": "tatiyā hi na vijjati. ",
  "snp5.1:27.1": "1008. ‘‘Sace agāraṃ āvasati , ",
  "snp5.1:27.2": "vijeyya pathaviṃ imaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:27.3": "Adaṇḍena asatthena, ",
  "snp5.1:27.4": "dhammenamanusāsati. ",
  "snp5.1:28.1": "1009. ‘‘Sace ca so pabbajati, ",
  "snp5.1:28.2": "agārā anagāriyaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:28.3": "Vivaṭṭacchado sambuddho, ",
  "snp5.1:28.4": "arahā bhavati anuttaro. ",
  "snp5.1:29.1": "1010. ‘‘Jātiṃ gottañca lakkhaṇaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:29.2": "mante sisse punāpare; ",
  "snp5.1:29.3": "Muddhaṃ muddhādhipātañca, ",
  "snp5.1:29.4": "manasāyeva pucchatha. ",
  "snp5.1:30.1": "1011. ‘‘Anāvaraṇadassāvī, ",
  "snp5.1:30.2": "yadi buddho bhavissati; ",
  "snp5.1:30.3": "Manasā pucchite pañhe, ",
  "snp5.1:30.4": "vācāya vissajessati’’. ",
  "snp5.1:31.1": "1012. Bāvarissa vaco sutvā, ",
  "snp5.1:31.2": "sissā soḷasa brāhmaṇā; ",
  "snp5.1:31.3": "Ajito tissametteyyo, ",
  "snp5.1:31.4": "puṇṇako atha mettagū. ",
  "snp5.1:32.1": "1013. Dhotako upasīvo ca, ",
  "snp5.1:32.2": "nando ca atha hemako; ",
  "snp5.1:32.3": "Todeyyakappā dubhayo, ",
  "snp5.1:32.4": "jatukaṇṇī ca paṇḍito. ",
  "snp5.1:33.1": "1014. Bhadrāvudho udayo ca, ",
  "snp5.1:33.2": "posālo cāpi brāhmaṇo; ",
  "snp5.1:33.3": "Mogharājā ca medhāvī, ",
  "snp5.1:33.4": "piṅgiyo ca mahāisi. ",
  "snp5.1:34.1": "1015. Paccekagaṇino sabbe, ",
  "snp5.1:34.2": "sabbalokassa vissutā; ",
  "snp5.1:34.3": "Jhāyī jhānaratā dhīrā, ",
  "snp5.1:34.4": "pubbavāsanavāsitā. ",
  "snp5.1:35.1": "1016. Bāvariṃ abhivādetvā, ",
  "snp5.1:35.2": "katvā ca naṃ padakkhiṇaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:35.3": "Jaṭājinadharā sabbe, ",
  "snp5.1:35.4": "pakkāmuṃ uttarāmukhā. ",
  "snp5.1:36.1": "1017. Aḷakassa patiṭṭhānaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:36.2": "purimāhissatiṃ tadā; ",
  "snp5.1:36.3": "Ujjeniñcāpi gonaddhaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:36.4": "vedisaṃ vanasavhayaṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:37.1": "1018. Kosambiñcāpi sāketaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:37.2": "sāvatthiñca puruttamaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:37.3": "Setabyaṃ kapilavatthuṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:37.4": "kusinārañca mandiraṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:38.1": "1019. Pāvañca bhoganagaraṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:38.2": "vesāliṃ māgadhaṃ puraṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:38.3": "Pāsāṇakaṃ cetiyañca, ",
  "snp5.1:38.4": "ramaṇīyaṃ manoramaṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:39.1": "1020. Tasitovudakaṃ sītaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:39.2": "mahālābhaṃva vāṇijo; ",
  "snp5.1:39.3": "Chāyaṃ ghammābhitattova, ",
  "snp5.1:39.4": "turitā pabbatamāruhuṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:40.1": "1021. Bhagavā tamhi samaye, ",
  "snp5.1:40.2": "bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhato; ",
  "snp5.1:40.3": "Bhikkhūnaṃ dhammaṃ deseti, ",
  "snp5.1:40.4": "sīhova nadatī vane. ",
  "snp5.1:41.1": "1022. Ajito addasa buddhaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:41.2": "sataraṃsiṃ va bhāṇumaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:41.3": "Candaṃ yathā pannarase, ",
  "snp5.1:41.4": "pāripūriṃ upāgataṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:42.1": "1023. Athassa gatte disvāna, ",
  "snp5.1:42.2": "paripūrañca byañjanaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:42.3": "Ekamantaṃ ṭhito haṭṭho, ",
  "snp5.1:42.4": "manopañhe apucchatha. ",
  "snp5.1:43.1": "1024. ‘‘Ādissa jammanaṃ brūhi, ",
  "snp5.1:43.2": "gottaṃ brūhi salakkhaṇaṃ ; ",
  "snp5.1:43.3": "Mantesu pāramiṃ brūhi, ",
  "snp5.1:43.4": "kati vāceti brāhmaṇo’’. ",
  "snp5.1:44.1": "1025. ‘‘Vīsaṃ vassasataṃ āyu, ",
  "snp5.1:44.2": "so ca gottena bāvarī; ",
  "snp5.1:44.3": "Tīṇissa lakkhaṇā gatte, ",
  "snp5.1:44.4": "tiṇṇaṃ vedāna pāragū. ",
  "snp5.1:45.1": "1026. ‘‘Lakkhaṇe itihāse ca, ",
  "snp5.1:45.2": "sanighaṇḍusakeṭubhe; ",
  "snp5.1:45.3": "Pañcasatāni vāceti, ",
  "snp5.1:45.4": "sadhamme pāramiṃ gato’’. ",
  "snp5.1:46.1": "1027. ‘‘Lakkhaṇānaṃ pavicayaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:46.2": "bāvarissa naruttama; ",
  "snp5.1:46.3": "Kaṅkhacchida pakāsehi, ",
  "snp5.1:46.4": "mā no kaṅkhāyitaṃ ahu’’. ",
  "snp5.1:47.1": "1028. ‘‘Mukhaṃ jivhāya chādeti, ",
  "snp5.1:47.2": "uṇṇassa bhamukantare; ",
  "snp5.1:47.3": "Kosohitaṃ vatthaguyhaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:47.4": "evaṃ jānāhi māṇava’’. ",
  "snp5.1:48.1": "1029. Pucchañhi kiñci asuṇanto, ",
  "snp5.1:48.2": "sutvā pañhe viyākate; ",
  "snp5.1:48.3": "Vicinteti jano sabbo, ",
  "snp5.1:48.4": "vedajāto katañjalī. ",
  "snp5.1:49.1": "1030. ‘‘Ko nu devo vā brahmā vā, ",
  "snp5.1:49.2": "indo vāpi sujampati; ",
  "snp5.1:49.3": "Manasā pucchite pañhe, ",
  "snp5.1:49.4": "kametaṃ paṭibhāsati. ",
  "snp5.1:50.1": "1031. ‘‘Muddhaṃ muddhādhipātañca, ",
  "snp5.1:50.2": "bāvarī paripucchati; ",
  "snp5.1:50.3": "Taṃ byākarohi bhagavā, ",
  "snp5.1:50.4": "kaṅkhaṃ vinaya no ise’’. ",
  "snp5.1:51.1": "1032. ‘‘Avijjā muddhāti jānāhi, ",
  "snp5.1:51.2": "vijjā muddhādhipātinī; ",
  "snp5.1:51.3": "Saddhāsatisamādhīhi, ",
  "snp5.1:51.4": "chandavīriyena saṃyutā’’. ",
  "snp5.1:52.1": "1033. Tato vedena mahatā, ",
  "snp5.1:52.2": "santhambhitvāna māṇavo; ",
  "snp5.1:52.3": "Ekaṃsaṃ ajinaṃ katvā, ",
  "snp5.1:52.4": "pādesu sirasā pati. ",
  "snp5.1:53.1": "1034. ‘‘Bāvarī brāhmaṇo bhoto, ",
  "snp5.1:53.2": "saha sissehi mārisa; ",
  "snp5.1:53.3": "Udaggacitto sumano, ",
  "snp5.1:53.4": "pāde vandati cakkhuma’’. ",
  "snp5.1:54.1": "1035. ‘‘Sukhito bāvarī hotu, ",
  "snp5.1:54.2": "saha sissehi brāhmaṇo; ",
  "snp5.1:54.3": "Tvañcāpi sukhito hohi, ",
  "snp5.1:54.4": "ciraṃ jīvāhi māṇava. ",
  "snp5.1:55.1": "1036. ‘‘Bāvarissa ca tuyhaṃ vā, ",
  "snp5.1:55.2": "sabbesaṃ sabbasaṃsayaṃ; ",
  "snp5.1:55.3": "Katāvakāsā pucchavho, ",
  "snp5.1:55.4": "yaṃ kiñci manasicchatha’’. ",
  "snp5.1:56.1": "1037. Sambuddhena katokāso, ",
  "snp5.1:56.2": "nisīditvāna pañjalī; ",
  "snp5.1:56.3": "Ajito paṭhamaṃ pañhaṃ, ",
  "snp5.1:56.4": "tattha pucchi tathāgataṃ. ",
  "snp5.1:56.5": "Vatthugāthā niṭṭhitā. "
}
